# oracle: fix srd with overlap yes and slip collisions with big spheres in rigid dimers, 2d (cut-down of examples/ASPHERE/dimer/in.dimer: the 200-atom data file, SRD density 10 per unit area instead of 85, 60 steps of the SRD phase)
# oracle-inputs: w79srd_dimer.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-13 skip=press,f_2[1],f_2[5] atomskip=fx,fy,fz
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): over 60 steps the engine agrees with the temperatures, energies, collision and bounce counts and the positions and velocities to a relative error of 1e-12. Skipped: press (at the setup of the SRD phase, the fix rigid virial of the redefined bodies differs: about 258 against 121 in this case; the same bodies in a run without fix srd show it too), f_2[1] (the candidate count differs by 9 at step 10: the engine rebuilds its neighbor lists when a periodic wrap of a big particle looks like a move, native does not), and f_2[5] (the rescale count differs by 6 at the first SRD rotation, step 20; at mass 0.01 it agrees). Beyond step 67 the bounce count of one SRD particle differs (collisions with two touching spheres of a dimer), so the case stops at 60 steps; the run to 200 steps does not agree.
units		lj
atom_style	sphere
atom_modify	map array first big
dimension	2

fix		molprop all property/atom mol ghost yes
read_data	w79srd_dimer.data fix molprop NULL Molecules
set		type 1 mass 1.0
group		big type 1
velocity	big create 1.44 87287 loop geom

pair_style	soft 1.12
pair_coeff	1 1 0.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 0.0
variable	prefactor equal ramp(0,60)
fix		soft all adapt 1 pair soft a * * v_prefactor
fix		1 big rigid molecule
fix		2 all enforce2d
thermo		100
run		100
unfix		soft
unfix		1
unfix		2

region		plane block INF INF INF INF -0.001 0.001 units box
lattice		sq 10.0
create_atoms	2 region plane
set		type 2 mass 0.1
group		small type 2
velocity	small create 1.0 593849 loop geom

pair_style	lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0 0.5

delete_atoms	overlap 0.5 small big
reset_timestep	0

neighbor	0.3 multi
neigh_modify	delay 0 every 1 check yes
comm_modify	mode multi group big vel yes
neigh_modify	include big

pair_style	lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0 0.0

timestep	0.001
fix		1 big rigid molecule
fix		2 small srd 20 big 1.0 0.25 49894 shift yes 54979 search 0.2 collision slip inside ignore overlap yes
fix		3 all enforce2d
compute		tbig big temp/sphere
variable	pebig equal pe*atoms/count(big)
variable	ebig equal etotal*atoms/count(big)
thermo_style	custom step temp f_2[8] etotal v_pebig v_ebig press f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[5] f_2[6] f_2[7] f_2[9] f_2[10] f_2[11] f_2[12]
thermo_modify	temp tbig format float %.15g
thermo		20
run		60
